{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56757","headline":"有神降於郑绎（《说郛》作「浠」、《古今说海》作「洚」）家吟诗 · 不详","name":"有神降於郑绎（《说郛》作「浠」、《古今说海》作「洚」）家吟诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忽然湖上片云飞，不觉舟中雨湿衣。\n折得莲花浑忘却，空将荷叶盖头归。\n（见《类说》卷八、《说郛》卷四及《古今说海》本戴孚《广异记》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56757.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56757","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}